Domain Entity CalendarEvent [2610]
    documentation "The type of scheduled or unscheduled event for the day."
    date Date [2611]
        documentation "The month, day, and year of the CalendarEvent."
        is part of identity
    descriptor CalendarEventCategory [2612]
        documentation "The type of scheduled or unscheduled event for the day."
        is part of identity
    shared decimal EventDuration [2613]
        documentation "The amount of time for the event as recognized by the school: 1 day = 1, 1/2 day = 0.5, 1/3 day = 0.33."
        is required
    domain entity Calendar [2614]
        documentation "Reference to the Calendar associated to the CalendarEvent."
        is part of identity